===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c|loc=торгу́|adj=торго́вый|dim=торжо́к}}

# [[haggling]], [[bargaining]]
#: {{coi|ru|'''торг''' неуме́стен|the price is fixed|lit='''bargaining''' is inappropriate}}
